{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8001_p", "source_sha256": "03ba0c04ce266cf0a31305d96c691fab72df9359bbd51abc30e78f3ce6c57882", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n企画。やよいのテーマは、迷子を保護する警察官だ）", "zh": "（今天是为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真企划。弥生的主题是保护走失儿童的警察）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8002_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab04a6b09bb31aa53c39898e244fa0156c98c4f8fe515446016167f6984e9485", "ja": "さっき、迷子役の子に挨拶してきたんですけど、\nすっごく緊張してるみたいでした……。", "zh": "刚才我去跟扮演迷路小孩的孩子打了招呼，她好像特别紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8003_p", "source_sha256": "22864023ba5dc764e992b5fbecda0958f98db3310aefe5f23b6c889445ff3356", "ja": "そうか……。撮影が始まるまでに、\nなんとか緊張をほぐしてあげたいな。", "zh": "这样啊……希望能在拍摄开始前，想办法帮她缓解一下紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8004_005yay", "source_sha256": "d51db2b27f4e2f8ada0ff963d1f92484929b8c2e4bcbd452ccad9dbad12e69ea", "ja": "はいっ、私もそう思ってました！　一緒に遊んだり\nしたら、少しはリラックスできるのかなーって。", "zh": "是的，我也是这么想的！要是一起玩玩什么的，应该多少能放松一点吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8005_005yay", "source_sha256": "fca154220a135f8645655574365462b8efdae29c60812db425b28bff6456fb88", "ja": "でも、どんな遊びがいいか迷ってるんです。\n{$P$}は、何がいいと思いますか？", "zh": "不过，我正在苦恼该玩什么游戏才好。\n{$P$}先生，您觉得玩什么好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8006", "source_sha256": "116dc62c4be2c6b1068160c3ecb04783427dc38f8f3d928b7fad31b9c244d3cc", "ja": "ボール遊び", "zh": "玩球", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8007", "source_sha256": "c78a080251dafb3995271c38a716fae87f22c56547a955c74450edd946070521", "ja": "にらめっこ", "zh": "对视", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8008", "source_sha256": "2a3bfc6dba5b2a093adf9da993bd2d63602ddef2861deed99bbcac499e9eee1a", "ja": "おまじない", "zh": "咒语", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8100_p", "source_sha256": "3d32e99fbdc25d1b95ae53cc76a4338eae7b7f6c45c99dc1496496e41d6e8026", "ja": "ボールで遊んでみるのはどうだ？\n体を動かせば、気持ちもほぐれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "要不要试试玩球？\n活动一下身体，心情也会放松些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8101_005yay", "source_sha256": "a10cb2ddb40c11bf05f1e0cf0217d38b02124fad6c8faecb44251033f168b2d7", "ja": "わあ～！　いいですね！　ボールを使った遊びは\n弟達といっぱいやったので、任せてください！", "zh": "哇～！好呀！用球玩的游戏我和弟弟们玩过很多，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8102_005yay", "source_sha256": "fd12e9eb907eb5823814bba5155d92ec7482f18cfd07776ee367afef2d6e8f60", "ja": "ボールを投げっこしながら、おしゃべりして……\nえへへ、楽しそうですー！　私、声かけてきますね！", "zh": "一边互相扔球，一边聊天……\n嘿嘿，感觉会很开心！我这就去叫大家过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8200_p", "source_sha256": "80b6df259d01559328f291eb140b126d8329e888329fecfe93775372043bc547", "ja": "にらめっことかいいんじゃないか？　変顔を見たり、\n自分でやったりしたら、笑ってくれると思うんだ。", "zh": "要不玩瞪眼比赛？互相做鬼脸、看看对方的怪表情，我觉得这样她就会笑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8201_005yay", "source_sha256": "d0e8ecd6c22770c1b39c0266fb455df4e66d1566d38954f5a6194569ba8475da", "ja": "そうですね！　あっ、せっかくなので、\n{$P$}も一緒にやりませんか？", "zh": "是啊！啊，难得有这个机会，{$P$}也一起来玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8202_005yay", "source_sha256": "918add26ccc1b927c7c5e5dd4a15c8d3a99d4eeaa03a511806d5326e1e76fa38", "ja": "迷子役の子も{$P$}も、\n私がみーんな、ニコニコにしちゃいますよー！", "zh": "扮演迷路小孩的孩子和{$P$}，我会把大家全都逗得笑眯眯的哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8300_p", "source_sha256": "92777b8f090afc6e96af3b50bafc21d1b705c934a3c429d15dcea105230e6d9e", "ja": "手のひらに『人』って文字を3回書いて、\n飲み込んでもらうのはどうだ？　緊張に効くぞ！", "zh": "在手掌心写3遍“人”字，然后把它喝下去，怎么样？对缓解紧张很有效哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8301_005yay", "source_sha256": "31e818825a5d59c1f76577aa3724ee1e27493d9613fdc2ef56ba8a7014e76aa1", "ja": "あれっ？　それって遊びじゃなくて、おまじない……？\nうーん、本当に効くのかな～？", "zh": "咦？那个不是游戏，是咒语吗……？\n唔～真的会管用吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_8302_005yay", "source_sha256": "782d991e306a8f355588b07140e414bc45526ae07c2d6e411c320449713fd8a4", "ja": "おまじないが効かなかった時のために、\n私、他の遊びも考えておきますね！", "zh": "为了防止咒语不灵，\n我也会先想好其他游戏的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
